msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_80D20F98_39D0_487E_819C_2D75F6AF6F1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her body was covered with an array of wounds, but the most prominent was the man’s singular "
"sword standing tall in her chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il suo corpo era ricoperto da una serie di ferite, ma la cosa più evidente era la "
"caratteristica e insolita spada dell’uomo, dritta, conficcata nel suo petto."

